      "en": "As for the saints who are on the earth, they are the excellent ones in whom is all my delight.",
      "ko": "땅에 있는 성도는 존귀한 자니 나의 모든 즐거움이 저희에게 있도다",
      "source_text_hash": "37a0de83d52b989be687d07d8295925642b954a17c4c4f2ea32e2ef338d21d5a",
      "translation_text_hash": "b7de18a0bf6e631a087203246209616904a7d46aaae0e8a2a77b063c4de54153",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
