      ],
      "en": "I will bless the LORD, who has given me counsel. Yes, my heart instructs me in the night seasons.",
      "ko": "나를 훈계하신 여호와를 송축할찌라 밤마다 내 심장이 나를 교훈하도다",
      "source_text_hash": "5181dde7c15bfbea62971832585747ae34a73aed15c1697d3eb5be6a96a31d46",
      "translation_text_hash": "908c159ab3cda1af133ffeafbc8f0ef0de4b9c18c086344418e826f748fd8989",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "나를 훈계하신 여호와를 송축할찌라 밤마다 내 심장이 나를 교훈하도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "908c159ab3cda1af133ffeafbc8f0ef0de4b9c18c086344418e826f748fd8989"
      ]
    },
